        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>§4-3 体内物质的运输 手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#f4f2ea;\n    font-family:\"Kaiti SC\",\"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n    font-size:15px;\n    color:#1a3fa0;\n    line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:760px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    padding:26px 30px 40px 74px;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0px, transparent 31px, #cfd6de 31px, #cfd6de 32px);\n    position:relative;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    min-height:1000px;\n  }\n  .page:before{\n    content:\"\";\n    position:absolute;\n    left:56px; top:0; bottom:0;\n    width:1px;\n    background:#d9a3a3;\n  }\n  h1.title{\n    font-size:19px;\n    font-weight:normal;\n    margin:0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .indent1{margin-left:34px;}\n  .indent2{margin-left:66px;}\n  .indent3{margin-left:100px;}\n  .indent4{margin-left:132px;}\n  .row{display:flex; align-items:center; margin:4px 0;}\n  .brace{\n    font-size:14px;\n    line-height:1;\n    display:inline-block;\n    margin:0 6px;\n    transform:scaleY(2.2);\n  }\n  .brace-lg{transform:scaleY(3.4);}\n  .stack{display:inline-block;}\n  .stack div{margin:2px 0;}\n  .hl-green{color:#1a3fa0; border-bottom:2px solid #57c98a;}\n  .hl-pink{color:#1a3fa0; border-bottom:2px solid #e69ab8;}\n  .green{color:#1f8a4c;}\n  .red{color:#c0392b;}\n  .pink{color:#d2478c;}\n  .item{margin:5px 0;}\n  .sub{margin-left:20px;}\n  .note{margin-left:120px;}\n  .small{font-size:14px;}\n  .placeholder{\n    border:1px dashed #9aa4b1;\n    color:#6b7480;\n    font-size:12px;\n    text-align:center;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .side-note{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:4px;\n    font-size:11px;\n    color:#8a93a0;\n    writing-mode:vertical-rl;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"side-note\" style=\"top:40px;\">[手写侧边字迹: illegible]</div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">§ 4-3 体内物质的运输</h1>\n\n  <!-- 血液循环系统 大括号 -->\n  <div class=\"row indent2\">\n    <span>血液循环系统</span>\n    <span class=\"brace brace-lg\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"stack\">\n      <div>血液</div>\n      <div>心脏</div>\n      <div>血管</div>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item indent1\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">一. 血液(约为体重的 7%～8%)</div>\n\n  <!-- 1. 血液 -->\n  <div class=\"row indent2\">\n    <span>1. 血液</span>\n    <span class=\"brace brace-lg\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n        <span>血浆(55%)</span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left:14px;\">水、无机盐、葡萄糖、蛋白质等</span>\n        <span class=\"green\" style=\"margin-left:26px;\">运载血细胞，运输养料和废物</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <span>血细胞(45%)</span>\n        <span class=\"brace\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"stack\">\n          <div class=\"red\">红细胞</div>\n          <div>白细胞</div>\n          <div>血小板</div>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    一次失血超过体内血量的 <span class=\"hl-green\">30%</span>，就会危及生命\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2. 红细胞 -->\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">2. 红细胞</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(1)特点：数量最多，呈两面凹的圆盘状，增加表面积，携氧量</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(2)数量：正常男性平均为 500 万个/mm<sup>3</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"item indent4\" style=\"margin-left:172px;\">正常女性平均为 420 万个/mm<sup>3</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(3)功能：<span class=\"hl-green\">运输氧和部分二氧化碳</span></div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(4)成熟红细胞的特点，在氧浓度高的地方容易和氧结合，在氧浓度低的地方容易与氧分离</div>\n\n  <!-- 3. 白细胞 -->\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">3. 白细胞</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(1)特点：数量少，有细胞核，体积比红细胞大</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(2)数量：一般为 4000～10000 个/mm<sup>3</sup>，血液范围内流动</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(3)功能：<span class=\"hl-green\">吞噬侵入人体内的细菌，保护人体免受病害</span></div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(4)功能???  <span class=\"hl-pink\">机体防御和保护功能，主要是能做变形运动和吞噬运动，具有免疫功能</span></div>\n  <div class=\"item\" style=\"margin-left:140px;\">(数量少[与红细胞数量比约为1:600]但种类多)</div>\n\n  <!-- 4. 血小板 -->\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">4. 血小板</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(1)特点：形状不规则，无细胞核，很小</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" style=\"margin-left:172px;\">直径约 2～4 μm，体积仅相当于红细胞的十[?]一，是血液中最小的有形成分</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(2)数量：正常成人 10万～30万个/mm<sup>3</sup></div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">(3)功能：<span class=\"hl-green\">加速血液凝固，防止大量血液外流</span><span class=\"hl-pink\">阻止细菌入侵</span></div>\n\n  <!-- 5. -->\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">5. 人体血细胞数量变化及症状</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">红细胞  若数目减少，容易<span class=\"hl-green\">贫血</span></div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">白细胞  若数目增多，容易身体有炎症</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">血小板  若数目减少，不能凝血</div>\n\n  <!-- 6. -->\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">6. 血细胞的寿命</div>\n  <div class=\"item indent3\">血细胞都有一定的寿命。红细胞寿命约为120天，大约60天后红细胞更换一半，<span class=\"hl-pink\">红骨髓有造血功能</span></div>\n\n  <!-- 7. -->\n  <div class=\"item indent2\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">7. 血液的功能</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
